        "The planned and realized sequences are AB, BA, AB, and BA for assessors P1 through P4, and every cell position matches its realized assignment.",
        "P1 records A 2 to 6 and B 3 to 4; P2 records A 3 to 6 and B 4 to 4.",
        "P3 records A 2 to 5 and B 3 to 4; P4 records A 4 to 7 and B 5 to 5.",
        "There are no missing or duplicated canonical cells."
      ],
      "inventory_state": {
        "measurement_mode": "DISCRETE_RATING",
        "protocol_state": "QUALIFIED",
        "realized_order_state": "BALANCED"
      },
      "expected_decision": "COMPLETE: the paired difference-in-change supports the predeclared left-greater contrast and records a crossover.",
      "critical_error": "Using unpaired late medians, ignoring realized order, or claiming liking.",
